{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those "}, {"text": "جَزَآؤُهُم", "translation": "their reward"}, {"text": "مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) forgiveness"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رَّبِّهِمْ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَجَنَّـٰتٌۭ", "translation": "and Gardens"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flows"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "underneath it"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ", "translation": "the rivers"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدِينَ", "translation": "abiding forever"}, {"text": "فِيهَا ۚ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَنِعْمَ", "translation": "And an excellent"}, {"text": "أَجْرُ", "translation": "reward"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَـٰمِلِينَ", "translation": "(for) the (righteous) workers"}], "sahih": "Those - their reward is forgiveness from their Lord and gardens beneath which rivers flow [in Paradise], wherein they will abide eternally; and excellent is the reward of the [righteous] workers."}